C R5 OL DEP-025 | MUST NOT (PreToolUse block before execution, fails closed) | Do not bypass incompatible peer dependencies with npm/pnpm/yarn --force, -f or --legacy-peer-deps (also via npm_config_force / npm_config_legacy_peer_deps environment assignments); resolve the conflict as add-dependency describes. The PreToolUse hook blocks such commands. | Bash and PowerShell package-manager commands, including wrapped shells up to depth 3 | If the user explicitly decides to override, the user runs the command.
