C R7 OL ARC-020,GOV-017 | REQUIRES_APPROVAL (Reserved) | Reserved decisions need explicit approval before implementation: changing an accepted project or architecture decision; adopting a new architectural style or pattern (CQRS, mediator, Vertical Slice Architecture, event sourcing, microservices, Rich Domain Model or DDD tactical patterns); adding a production project/layer/assembly; changing persistence boundaries (incl. multiple persistence contexts) or persistence technology; adding an infrastructure category (messaging, background processing, distributed cache, search, external storage, external identity); adding a major library/framework or replacing approved baseline technology; introducing a project-wide convention or abstraction (e.g. a project-wide Result model); changing the authentication/authorization architecture; a breaking public API change. | engineering decisions | none stated
